","textMapHash":2909786626,"text":"……！","nextNodeIds":[765100114]},{"nodeId":765100114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1200379874,"text":"うわわっ！あいつら、一局交えるって意味じゃなかったのか！？","nextNodeIds":[765100115]},{"nodeId":765100115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30956,"speakerName":"エドラー","textMapHash":3067164218,"text":"三秒だけあげるから、降参したら——？","nextNodeIds":[765100116]},{"nodeId":765100116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30956,"speakerName":"エドラー","textMapHash":3197816482,"text":"三、二、一…","nextNodeIds":[765100117]},{"nodeId":765100117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3347080914,"text":"わぁーっ！","nextNodeIds":[765100118]},{"nodeId":765100118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":836754250,"text":"「カチッ」と金属音が響くと、後は静寂に包まれた…","nextNodeIds":[765100119]},{"nodeId":765100119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30956,"speakerName":"エドラー","textMapHash":3400687618,"text":"パイモンさん、目を開けて。","nextNodeIds":[765100120]},{"nodeId":765100120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30928,"speakerName":"ヴィスラヴァ","textMapHash":1993693098,"text":"外野のあなたが一番ビビってたみたいね。","nextNodeIds":[765100121]},{"nodeId":765100121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1579855898,"text":"な、なに？ヴィスラヴァ、無事だったのか？","nextNodeIds":[765100122,765100123]},{"nodeId":765100122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1979329986,"text":"エドラーはヴィスラヴァを脅してただけだよ。","nextNodeIds":[765100124]},{"nodeId":765100124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30956,"speakerName":"エドラー","textMapHash":3948754554,"text":"たとえよその土地でも、牢屋に入れられたくはないからね。","nextNodeIds":[765100125]},{"nodeId":765100125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30956,"speakerName":"エドラー","textMapHash":2017403554,"text":"私が簡単に操れるような商人じゃないってことを分かってもらうためには、虚勢を張るしかなかったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[765100126]},{"nodeId":765100126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30956,"speakerName":"エドラー","textMapHash":2561615130,"text":"そうすれば次に会った時、嫌がらせしようなんて思わなくなるでしょう？","nextNodeIds":[765100127]},{"nodeId":765100127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":149839522,"text":"#でも、{NICKNAME}はどうやって見抜いたんだ？全然ビビってなかったよな。","nextNodeIds":[765100128,765100129]},{"nodeId":765100128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3127681274,"text":"エドラーが落ち着いてたから。","nextNodeIds":[765100130]},{"nodeId":765100130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30928,"speakerName":"ヴィスラヴァ","textMapHash":178944786,"text":"鋭いね。確かに脅迫は、相手を降参させる一番簡単な方法だよ。でも残念ながら、そう簡単に近道はできるものじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[765100131]},{"nodeId":765100131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30928,"speakerName":"ヴィスラヴァ","textMapHash":3611284642,"text":"#ま、今は{NICKNAME}さんもここにいるしね…とにかく私は、ちゃんとここに立ってるわ。","nextNodeIds":[765100132]},{"nodeId":765100132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30928,"speakerName":"ヴィスラヴァ","textMapHash":462412458,"text":"ただ、次にチャンスがあれば…","nextNodeIds":[765100133]},{"nodeId":765100133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30956,"speakerName":"エドラー","textMapHash":1265211554,"text":"まさか、あなたのような方にお目にかかれる機会なんて、滅多にないよ。","nextNodeIds":[765100134]},{"nodeId":765100134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30956,"speakerName":"エドラー","textMapHash":2854313106,"text":"…もしあなたが仕事で私に手を出してくるなら、私も自衛するしかないけどね。","nextNodeIds":[765100135]},{"nodeId":765100135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30956,"speakerName":"エドラー","textMapHash":2283332250,"text":"でも…もしまた休暇中に会えたら、兵棋演習でもしよう。商売のためにも、付き合ってくれると助かるよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":765100129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2611491986,"text":"「どっちが先に降参するか」って言ってたから。","nextNodeIds":[765100130]},{"nodeId":765100123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1819618538,"text":"弾は入ってなかったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[765100124]},{"nodeId":765100110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerNa